(ACME CORP - EMPLOYEE HANDBOOK & KNOWLEDGE BASE) Tj
T* (Last Updated: October 2026) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. TRAVEL & EXPENSE POLICY) Tj
T* (1.1 Flights: All employees must book economy class tickets for domestic travel. For international travel exceeding 8) Tj
T* (hours, business class may be booked with prior approval from a VP.) Tj
T* (1.2 Hotels: The maximum nightly hotel rate is $250 in major cities \(New York, San Francisco, London, Tokyo\) and) Tj
T* ($150 elsewhere.) Tj
T* (1.3 Meals: Employees are allotted a daily per diem of $75 for meals while traveling. Receipts are only required for) Tj
T* (individual meals exceeding $25.) Tj
T* (1.4 Reimbursement: All expenses must be submitted via the Concur platform within 30 days of the trip's conclusion.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. IT SECURITY & DEVICE POLICY) Tj
T* (2.1 Passwords: Must be at least 14 characters long, containing upper, lower, numbers, and symbols. Passwords) Tj
T* (expire every 90 days.) Tj
T* (2.2 Hardware: Employees are issued a standard MacBook Pro or Dell XPS. Upgrades require manager approval) Tj
T* (and a valid business case \(e.g., software engineering, video editing\).) Tj
T* (2.3 Data Classification:) Tj
T* (- Public: Safe for external release \(e.g., marketing materials\).) Tj
T* (- Internal: Safe for all employees, but not external \(e.g., company all-hands slides\).) Tj
T* (- Confidential: Restricted to specific teams \(e.g., unreleased financial data, HR records\).) Tj
T* (2.4 USB Drives: The use of unencrypted personal USB drives on company laptops is strictly prohibited.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. HUMAN RESOURCES & TIME OFF) Tj
T* (3.1 PTO: Full-time employees accrue 20 days of Paid Time Off annually. Up to 5 days may roll over to the following) Tj
T* (calendar year.) Tj
T* (3.2 Sick Leave: Employees receive 10 days of paid sick leave per year.) Tj
T* (3.3 Parental Leave: Acme Corp offers 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave for primary and secondary caregivers) Tj
T* (following the birth or adoption of a child.) Tj
T* (3.4 Core Hours: While we operate on a flexible schedule, all employees are expected to be online and available for) Tj
T* (meetings during the core hours of 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM in their local timezone.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. PRODUCT & ENGINEERING) Tj
T* (4.1 Deployment: No production deployments are allowed on Fridays without explicitly documented VP approval) Tj
T* (\(The "No-Deploy Friday" rule\).) Tj
T* (4.2 Code Reviews: All pull requests must be approved by at least two senior engineers before merging to the main) Tj
T* (branch.) Tj
T* (4.3 SLAs: The engineering team maintains a 99.99% uptime SLA for external APIs. Priority 1 \(P1\) incidents require) Tj
T* (an initial response within 15 minutes.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. ESCALATION MATRIX) Tj
T* (5.1 Tier 1: General queries and basic troubleshooting \(handled by AgentForge AI\).) Tj
T* (5.2 Tier 2: Account lockouts and billing disputes \(Human Operations Team\).) Tj
T* (5.3 Tier 3: Security breaches and infrastructure outages \(On-call Engineering Team\).) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
